CampusBuzz

CampusBuzz is a web application for managing and promoting campus events. Administrators can add, view, edit, and delete events, with data stored in a SQL Server database.

Tech Stack
Angular
.NET 8 Web API
Entity Framework Core
SQL Server
xUnit
Features
View events with titles, locations, and ticket prices.
Create, edit, and delete events.
Form validation to ensure all required fields are completed.
Unit testing for event retrieval.
Getting Started

Backend

Open the api folder in Visual Studio.
Update the database connection string if needed.
Apply database migrations and run the API.

Frontend

Navigate to the angular folder.
Run npm install.
Run ng serve and open the local URL provided.
